From: Implementing AI <ai@example.com>
Date: Sat, 29 Aug 2026 14:56:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] item 1: in-house LaTeX rendering, scoped to fenced blocks

~110 symbols and a recursive-descent parser in js/18-utils.js. No
dependency, no CDN, no vendored fonts. Every leaf goes through
escapeHtml; class names are fixed literals.

- js/18-utils.js: renderer + latex/math/tex fence hook ahead of the
  generic fence handler; mathSourceSafe for the source view
- css/16-math.css: layout (new file, linked in chat.html)
- math-preview.html: visual check against the real renderer + CSS
- test-math-render.mjs: 141 assertions
